# research.md (rev1) 主張別 原典照合表 v2 — 生取得テキストとの文字列照合 — Reviewer t4

対象成果物: `research.md` revision 1 / sha256 `ff60d0a1a92a…`（本タスクでは**書き換えていない**）
照合元（すべて researcher/t3 が publish した web_fetch 生取得テキスト）:

- `fetch-raw-deepagents.txt` rev1 / sha256 `8e8c922995aa…` — META: `url=https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents status=200 retrieved_at=2026-09-13T04:53:39.061Z truncated=False truncated_chars=0 max_chars_requested=40000`
- `fetch-raw-deerflow.txt` rev1 / sha256 `d1febcdf5a97…` — META 2本: (1) `url=https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow status=200 retrieved_at=2026-09-13T04:53:40.058Z truncated=True truncated_chars=28425`、(2) `url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bytedance/deer-flow/main/README.md`（`truncated_chars=28180`）
- `fetch-raw-agentskills.txt` rev1 / sha256 `cc0bf85967be…` — META: `url=https://agentskills.io/specification status=200 retrieved_at=2026-09-13T04:53:45.427Z truncated=False truncated_chars=0`
- `fetch-raw-licenses.txt` rev1 / sha256 `df9a0a815cf0…` — deer-flow / deepagents の `LICENSE` 本文（ともに status=200）

## 本レビューで実際に実行したこと（証拠）

1. `read_artifact` で上記4ファイル＋`claim-check.md` rev1＋`research.md` rev1 を読み取り。
   - `fetch-raw-deepagents.txt` / `fetch-raw-agentskills.txt` / `fetch-raw-licenses.txt` は**全文**を読めた（前2者は `truncated=False`＝原典全文）。
   - `fetch-raw-deerflow.txt` は read_artifact 側の表示制限により末尾約12,754文字が読み取れず（`...[truncated 12754 chars; stored in full in the event log]`）。この範囲は下記2の文字列検索で照合した。
2. `run_check` による生テキストへの文字列/正規表現検索（= grep 相当、ファイル全体が対象）:
   - `text_contains(fetch-raw-deerflow.txt, 23語)` → **pass**（missing なし）: `Doubao-Seed-2.0-Code`, `DeepSeek v3.2`, `Kimi 2.5`, `InfoQuest`, `BytePlus`, `make doctor`, `make setup`, `config.yaml`, `Windsurf`, `Deployment Sizing`, `Option 2: Local Development`, `README_ja.md`, `Русский`, `OpenRouter`, `use_responses_api`, `vllm_provider`, `Codex CLI`, `Claude Code OAuth`, `Terminal Workbench (TUI)`, `Embedded Python Client`, `Scheduled Tasks`, `Improper Deployment May Introduce Security Risks`, `deer-flow`
   - `text_contains(fetch-raw-deerflow.txt, ["img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg"])` → **pass**
   - `text_contains(fetch-raw-deerflow.txt, ["META url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bytedance/deer-flow/main/README.md"])` → **pass**（2本目の META が raw README であることを確認）
   - `regex_count(fetch-raw-deerflow.txt, "META url=[^\n]*")` → count=**2**
   - `regex_count(fetch-raw-deerflow.txt, "truncated_chars=(28425|18425|28180)")` → count=**2**、`regex_count("truncated_chars=28180")` → count=**1** ⇒ 2本目（raw README）が 28180、1本目（GitHub ページ）が 28425、**18425 はファイル内に存在しない**
   - `text_not_contains(fetch-raw-agentskills.txt, ["All rights reserved","©","Creative Commons","MIT","Copyright","copyright","LICENSE.md","licensed under"])` → **pass**（いずれも不在）
3. `run_check command` で artifact をワークスペースに展開できないことを確認済み（`ls` に該当ファイルなし）。したがって照合は read_artifact ＋ run_check の文字列検索で実施した。

判定凡例: **実在** = 生取得テキスト内に該当記述が存在（該当箇所を引用）/ **不一致** = 生テキストの実際の表記と食い違う / **生テキスト範囲外** = 切り詰め・別事象（再取得時刻の差など）により照合不能

---

## A. langchain-ai/deepagents（照合元: `fetch-raw-deepagents.txt` rev1、truncated=False＝全文）

| # | research.md の主張 | 判定 | 生テキストの該当箇所（引用） |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| A1 | 「The batteries-included agent harness.」 | 実在 | `GitHub - langchain-ai/deepagents: The batteries-included agent harness. · GitHub` / About 欄 `The batteries-included agent harness.` |
| A2 | 「Deep Agents is an open source agent harness — an opinionated agent that runs out of the box. Extend, override, or replace any piece.」 | 実在 | `Deep Agents is an open source agent harness — an opinionated agent that runs out of the box. Extend, override, or replace any piece.`（逐語一致） |
| A3 | 原則4点 Opinionated / Extensible / Model-agnostic / Production-ready | 実在 | `Principles:` 直後に `Opinionated — defaults tuned for long-horizon, multi-step work` / `Extensible — override or replace any piece without forking` / `Model-agnostic — works with any LLM that supports tool calling: frontier, open-weight, or local` / `Production-ready — built on LangGraph (streaming, persistence, checkpointing) with first-class tracing, evaluation, and deployment via LangSmith` |
| A4 | Features 8項目 | 実在 | `Features include:` 以下に `Sub-agents` / `Filesystem` / `Context management` / `Shell access` / `Persistent memory` / `Human-in-the-loop` / `Skills` / `Tools` の8件（順序も一致） |
| A5 | `uv add deepagents` と `create_deep_agent(...)` | 実在 | `Quickstart` 節に `uv add deepagents`、`from deepagents import create_deep_agent` / `agent = create_deep_agent( model="openai:gpt-5.5", ...)` |
| A6 | 「available as a JavaScript/TypeScript library — see deepagents.js」 | 実在 | `Deep Agents is available as a JavaScript/TypeScript library — see deepagents.js .`（原文は HTML 由来でリンク語 `deepagents.js` の前後が改行分割） |
| A7 | 「Deep Agents Code — a pre-built coding agent in your terminal, similar to Claude Code or Cursor, powered by any LLM.」 | 実在 | `Deep Agents Code — a pre-built coding agent in your terminal, similar to Claude Code or Cursor, powered by any LLM.`（逐語一致） |
| A8 | 「Inspired by Claude Code: an attempt to identify what makes it general-purpose, and push that further.」 | 実在 | `Acknowledgements` 節 `Inspired by Claude Code: an attempt to identify what makes it general-purpose, and push that further.`（逐語一致） |
| A9 | FAQ の層構造説明（LangGraph=graph runtime / `create_agent`=最小ハーネス / Deep Agents=より opinionated） | 実在（要約として正確） | `How is this different from LangGraph or LangChain?` → `LangGraph is the graph runtime. LangChain's create_agent is a minimal agent harness on top of it. Deep Agents is a more opinionated harness on top of create_agent — same building blocks, but with filesystem, sub-agents, context management, and skills bundled in.` |
| A10 | 「Yes! Deep Agents is built on LangGraph, designed for production agent deployments.」 | 実在 | `Can I use this in production?` → `Yes! Deep Agents is built on LangGraph, designed for production agent deployments.`（逐語一致） |
| A11 | 「Yes. Any model that supports tool calling works」＋ Ollama / vLLM / llama.cpp | 実在 | `Yes. Any model that supports tool calling works — frontier APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google), open-weight models hosted on providers like Baseten or Fireworks, and self-hosted models via Ollama, vLLM, or llama.cpp.` |
| A12 | 「Use Deep Agents when you want the full harness — planning, context management, delegation — out of the box.」 | 実在 | `Use Deep Agents when you want the full harness — planning, context management, delegation — out of the box.`（逐語一致） |
| A13 | 対象読者の明示節は無い（本文からの読み取り） | 実在（不在を全文で確認） | 生テキスト全文（truncated=False）に `Who is this for` / `Audience` / 「対象読者」に相当する見出しは存在しない。見出し相当は `Principles` / `Features include` / `Quickstart` / `FAQ` / `Resources` / `Acknowledgements` / `Security` / `About` のみ |
| A14 | ライセンス MIT（ナビ行と About 欄 Resources、ファイル一覧の `LICENSE`） | 実在 | ナビ行 `README` `Code of conduct` `Contributing` `MIT license` `Security`、About 欄 `Resources` `Readme` `MIT license`、ファイル一覧に `LICENSE`。**追加裏付け**: `fetch-raw-licenses.txt` に `MIT License / Copyright (c) LangChain, Inc.`（raw LICENSE, status=200） |
