## C. agentskills.io/specification（照合元: `fetch-raw-agentskills.txt` rev1、truncated=False＝全文）

| # | research.md の主張 | 判定 | 生テキストの該当箇所（引用） |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| C1 | 「The complete format specification for Agent Skills.」 | 実在 | `The complete format specification for Agent Skills.`（逐語一致） |
| C2 | 「A skill is a directory containing, at minimum, a `SKILL.md` file」＋ `scripts/` / `references/` / `assets/` | 実在 | `A skill is a directory containing, at minimum, a SKILL.md file:` およびツリー `├── scripts/ # Optional: executable code` `├── references/ # Optional: documentation` `├── assets/ # Optional: templates, resources` |
| C3 | 「must contain YAML frontmatter followed by Markdown content」 | 実在 | `The SKILL.md file must contain YAML frontmatter followed by Markdown content.` |
| C4 | `name`: 必須／**最大64文字**／小文字英数字とハイフン／先頭末尾ハイフン不可／連続ハイフン不可／親ディレクトリ名と一致 | 実在（数値含め全項目一致） | frontmatter 表 `name Yes Max 64 characters. Lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens only. Must not start or end with a hyphen.`、`name field` 節 `Must be 1-64 characters` / `May only contain unicode lowercase alphanumeric characters (a-z, 0-9) and hyphens (-)` / `Must not start or end with a hyphen (-)` / `Must not contain consecutive hyphens (--)` / `Must match the parent directory name` |
| C5 | `description`（必須/**最大1024文字**）、`compatibility`（任意/**最大500文字**）、`metadata`（任意/文字列→文字列）、`allowed-tools`（任意/空白区切り/Experimental） | 実在（数値含め全項目一致） | `description Yes Max 1024 characters. Non-empty.` / `Must be 1-1024 characters`；`compatibility No Max 500 characters.` / `Must be 1-500 characters if provided`；`metadata No Arbitrary key-value mapping ... (a map from string keys to string values)`；`allowed-tools No Space-separated string of pre-approved tools the skill may use. (Experimental)` |
| C6 | `license`（任意、ライセンス名または同梱ライセンスファイルへの参照） | 実在 | `license No License name or reference to a bundled license file.` / `We recommend keeping it short (either the name of a license or the name of a bundled license file)` |
| C7 | 「Metadata (~100 tokens)」「Instructions (< 5000 tokens recommended)」「Resources (as needed)」 | 実在 | `Metadata (~100 tokens): The name and description fields are loaded at startup for all skills` / `Instructions (< 5000 tokens recommended): The full SKILL.md body is loaded when the skill is activated` / `Resources (as needed): Files (e.g. those in scripts/ , references/ , or assets/ ) are loaded only when required` |
| C8 | 「Keep your main SKILL.md under 500 lines.」 | 実在 | `Keep your main SKILL.md under 500 lines. Move detailed reference material to separate files.`（**500 lines** で一致） |
| C9 | 「Keep file references one level deep from SKILL.md.」／相対パスは skill ルートから | 実在 | `When referencing other files in your skill, use relative paths from the skill root:` / `Keep file references one level deep from SKILL.md . Avoid deeply nested reference chains.` |
| C10 | 「Use the `skills-ref` reference library to validate your skills」／`skills-ref validate ./my-skill` | 実在 | `Use the skills-ref reference library to validate your skills:` / `skills-ref validate ./my-skill` |
| C11 | ナビ「For skill creators」（Quickstart / Best practices / Optimizing descriptions / Evaluating skills / Using scripts）と「For client implementors」（Adding skills support） | 実在 | `For skill creators` `Quickstart` `Best practices` `Optimizing descriptions` `Evaluating skills` `Using scripts` / `For client implementors` `Adding skills support`（項目・順序とも一致） |
| C12 | 「Clients can use this to store additional properties not defined by the Agent Skills spec」 | 実在 | `metadata field` 節 `Clients can use this to store additional properties not defined by the Agent Skills spec`（逐語一致） |
| C13 | 「Support for this field may vary between agent implementations」 | 実在 | `allowed-tools field` 節 `Experimental. Support for this field may vary between agent implementations` |
| C14 | 「Agent Skills now has an official Discord server.」 | 実在 | ページ冒頭バナー `Agent Skills now has an official Discord server . See the announcement for details.` |
| C15 | ライセンスは「記載なし（未確認）」＝ページ本文にサイト/仕様自体のライセンス表記が無い | 実在（不在を全文検索で確認） | `truncated=False`（全文）の生テキストに対し `text_not_contains(["All rights reserved","©","Creative Commons","MIT","Copyright","copyright","LICENSE.md","licensed under"])` → **pass**（8語すべて不在）。本文に現れる `license` は frontmatter フィールドの定義文脈のみ（`license field` 節、`license: Apache-2.0`、`license: Proprietary. LICENSE.txt has complete terms`）。※「サイト全体にライセンスが無い」ことの証明ではなく、当該ページ本文に表記が無いことの確認 |
| C16 | 本文中の `license` は SKILL.md frontmatter のフィールドであってサイトのライセンスではない（例 `license: Apache-2.0`、`license: Proprietary. LICENSE.txt has complete terms`） | 実在 | `license: Apache-2.0`（Example with optional fields）、`license: Proprietary. LICENSE.txt has complete terms`（license field 節の Example）、`Specifies the license applied to the skill` — いずれも逐語一致 |

